              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Chocolatecreamy"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this last night and it turned out delicious. I didn't add the pepper because thought would be spicy and didn't have any. Will be doing this again. It was different to have fried turkey wings instead of baking them. Thanks for recipe."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
